      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ダグザには偉大なる幾柱もの神々がおわし、\n上層の参道には、その方々を奉る神殿があります。\n一度は参詣しなければ、不敬にあたりましょう。\nどの神殿でも構いません。参拝にいらしてください。",
        "official_en": "While in Dagsion, it would be impious not to visit the\ntemples in hightown. Each is home to one of\nDagda's gods, and it does not matter which you\nvisit—you will find a peaceful place to worship.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
